  // Duplicated this due to the additional toolbar support in D2. Code in ToolbarItemsMasks() is copied from CSUI.
  // Following are newly added toolbars 'addToolbar','configurationToolbar','captionMenuToolbar'.
  // Keep the keys in sync with csui/widgets/nodestable/toolbaritems
